{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 13827720597422686296,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Creating components",
      "source_hash": 5462578893411376326,
      "context_hash": 17108241911314633493,
      "translation": "컴포넌트 만들기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:50:26.876557Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Many popular programming languages can be compiled to WebAssembly, but the level of support varies across languages.",
      "source_hash": 2520698580868629049,
      "context_hash": 8272999788753764921,
      "translation": "많은 인기 프로그래밍 언어가 WebAssembly로 컴파일될 수 있지만, 언어마다 지원 수준이 다릅니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:50:26.876558Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "This document details languages with compilers and runtimes that support WebAssembly with WASI as a target platform.",
      "source_hash": 15314524839811784207,
      "context_hash": 16645848750395407433,
      "translation": "이 문서는 WASI를 대상 플랫폼으로 하는 WebAssembly를 지원하는 컴파일러와 런타임을 갖춘 언어들을 상세히 다룹니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:50:26.876558Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "This is a living document, so if you are aware of advancements in a toolchain, please do not hesitate to [contribute documentation](https://github.com/bytecodealliance/component-docs/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md).",
      "source_hash": 12500039193322622817,
      "context_hash": 13947774032600751523,
      "translation": "이 문서는 계속 갱신되는 문서이므로, 툴체인의 발전 사항을 알고 계시다면 [문서 기여하기](https://github.com/bytecodealliance/component-docs/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)를 주저하지 마십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:50:26.876558Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "You can find more information about the development of support for specific languages in the [Guest Languages Special Interest Group Proposal](https://github.com/bytecodealliance/governance/blob/main/SIGs/SIG-guest-languages/proposal.md) document.",
      "source_hash": 5223045047483851195,
      "context_hash": 6967674705529162921,
      "translation": "특정 언어에 대한 지원 개발과 관련한 더 많은 정보는 [Guest Languages Special Interest Group Proposal](https://github.com/bytecodealliance/governance/blob/main/SIGs/SIG-guest-languages/proposal.md) 문서에서 찾을 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:50:26.876558Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "One of the benefits of components is their portability across host runtimes.",
      "source_hash": 15085890181338485042,
      "context_hash": 8298270873950178151,
      "translation": "컴포넌트의 이점 중 하나는 호스트 런타임 간의 이식성입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:50:26.876558Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "The runtime only needs to know what world the component is targeting in order to import or execute the component.",
      "source_hash": 1066004235952667362,
      "context_hash": 13611093199992137912,
      "translation": "런타임은 컴포넌트를 가져오거나 실행하기 위해 해당 컴포넌트가 어떤 월드를 대상으로 하는지만 알면 됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "runtime": "런타임",
        "world": "월드",
        "component": "컴포넌트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:50:26.876558Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:3/seg:2",
      "source": "This language guide hopes to demonstrate that with a prevailing `adder` world defined in [`examples/tutorial/wit/adder/world.wit`](https://github.com/bytecodealliance/component-docs/blob/main/component-model/examples/tutorial/wit/adder/world.wit).",
      "source_hash": 16793739850010281642,
      "context_hash": 17421087022500052659,
      "translation": "이 언어 가이드는 [`examples/tutorial/wit/adder/world.wit`](https://github.com/bytecodealliance/component-docs/blob/main/component-model/examples/tutorial/wit/adder/world.wit)에 정의된 일반적인 `adder` 월드를 통해 이를 보여주고자 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "world": "월드"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:50:26.876559Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:3/seg:3",
      "source": "Furthermore, an example host that understands the `example` world has been provided in [`examples/example-host`](https://github.com/bytecodealliance/component-docs/blob/main/component-model/examples/example-host/README.md) for running components.",
      "source_hash": 10781160562202118130,
      "context_hash": 17185275918486095343,
      "translation": "또한 컴포넌트 실행을 위해 `example` 월드를 이해하는 예제 호스트가 [`examples/example-host`](https://github.com/bytecodealliance/component-docs/blob/main/component-model/examples/example-host/README.md)에 제공되어 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "world": "월드"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:50:26.876559Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:3/seg:4",
      "source": "Each toolchain section walks through creating a component of this world, which can be run either in the example host or from an application of that toolchain.",
      "source_hash": 8129271396426437339,
      "context_hash": 14164968329179876574,
      "translation": "각 툴체인 섹션에서는 이 월드의 컴포넌트를 생성하는 과정을 다루며, 이렇게 생성한 컴포넌트는 예제 호스트에서 실행하거나 해당 툴체인의 애플리케이션에서 실행할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "component": "컴포넌트",
        "world": "월드"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:50:26.876559Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:3/seg:5",
      "source": "This aims to provide a full story for using components within and among toolchains.",
      "source_hash": 14655472549355001693,
      "context_hash": 14480492133163952602,
      "translation": "이는 툴체인 내에서 그리고 툴체인 간에 컴포넌트를 사용하는 완전한 이야기를 제공하는 것을 목표로 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:50:26.876559Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Each section covers how to build and run components for a given toolchain.",
      "source_hash": 14640641310796201301,
      "context_hash": 4939550909169083779,
      "translation": "각 섹션은 주어진 툴체인에 대해 컴포넌트를 빌드하고 실행하는 방법을 다룹니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:50:26.876559Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:4/seg:1",
      "source": "The last section, on WebAssembly Text Format (WAT), details how to write WebAssembly components by hand, without using a higher-level language front-end.",
      "source_hash": 17413223378005785794,
      "context_hash": 6424105360301263346,
      "translation": "마지막 섹션인 WebAssembly Text Format(WAT)에서는 상위 수준 언어 프론트엔드를 사용하지 않고 WebAssembly 컴포넌트를 직접 작성하는 방법을 상세히 다룹니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:50:26.876559Z",
      "issues": []
    },
